"first_line":118,"last_line":118,"line_start":0,"line_end":20,"raw_start":21153,"raw_end":21173,"raw_character_offsets":[21153,21154,21155,21156,21157,21158,21159,21160,21161,21162,21163,21164,21165,21166,21167,21168,21169,21170,21171,21172],"projection_sha256":"0c37403213f11d17bfa836af5b62cd4fa90141e198774f03c89c04e1f551421b"},"chapter_id":"c-hanshu-051-luwenshu-qi040","book_id":"b-hanshu-051","work_id":"w-hanshu","source_id":"s-hanshu-051-luwenshu-qi040-ws1748700"},{"id":"c-hanshu-051-luwenshu-qi040:p002","text":"臣聞秦有十失，其一尚存，治獄之吏是也。","mentions":[],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1748700,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":126,"last_line":126,"line_start":8,"line_end":27,"raw_start":21905,"raw_end":21924,"raw_character_offsets":[21905,21906,21907,21908,21909,21910,21911,21912,21913,21914,21915,21916,21917,21918,21919,21920,21921,21922,21923],"projection_sha256":"edb09dc94c684c85312a7a185aefba0831ba5f8e69ced69ba33dd1500b4d1286"},"chapter_id":"c-hanshu-051-luwenshu-qi040","book_id":"b-hanshu-051","work_id":"w-hanshu","source_id":"s-hanshu-051-luwenshu-qi040-ws1748700"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-wudi-appraisal:p001","text":"史臣曰：民之勞逸，隨所遭遇，習以成性，有識斯同。帝王子弟，生長尊貴，薪禽之道未知，富厚之圖已極。齠年稚齒，養器深宮，習趨拜之儀，受文句之學，坐躡搢紳，傍絕交友，情偽之事，不經耳目，憂懼之道，未涉胷衿，雖卓爾天悟，自得懷抱，孤寡爲識，所陋猶多。朝出閫閨，暮司方岳，帝子臨州，親民尚小，年序次第，宜屏皇家，防驕剪逸，積代恒典，平允之情，操捶貽慮。故輔以上佐，簡自帝心，勞舊左右，用爲主帥，州國府第，先令後行，飲食遊居，動應聞啓，端拱守祿，遵承法度，張弛之要，莫敢厝言，行事執其權，典籤掣其肘，苟利之義未申，專違之咎已及。處地雖重，行己莫由，威不在身，恩未接下，倉卒一朝，艱難總集，望其釋位扶危，不可得矣。路溫舒云：「秦有十失，其一尚存。」斯宋氏之餘風，在齊而彌弊也。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-wudi-appraisal:p001:m0300","surface":"路溫舒","start":300,"end":303,"person_id":"2r8_97h_fad_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_compiler_appraisal","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2272748,"source_layer":"received_compiler_appraisal","first_line":170,"last_line":170,"line_start":0,"line_end":331,"raw_start":11874,